#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dcshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:5520 rc.cpp:5524
#, kde-format
msgid "DC shift"
msgstr "Desplaçament de DC"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dcshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:5522
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Apply a DC shift to the audio.\n"
"This can be useful to remove a DC offset (caused perhaps by a hardware "
"problem in the recording chain) from the audio.\n"
"The effect of a DC offset is reduced headroom and hence volume. The astats "
"filter can be used to determine if a signal has a DC offset."
msgstr ""
"Aplica un desplaçament de DC a l'àudio.\n"
"Açò pot ser útil per a eliminar un desplaçament de DC (causat potser per un "
"problema de maquinari a la cadena de gravació) de l'àudio.\n"
"L'efecte d'un desplaçament de DC és un marge reduït i, per tant, el volum. "
"El filtre «astats» es pot utilitzar per a determinar si un senyal té un "
"desplaçament de DC."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dcshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:5526
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the DC shift, allowed range is [-1, 1]. It indicates the amount to shift "
"the audio."
msgstr ""
"Establix el desplaçament del DC, l'interval permés és [-1, 1]. Indica la "
"quantitat a desplaçar l'àudio."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dcshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:5528
#, kde-format
msgid "Limiter gain"
msgstr "Limitador del guany"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dcshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:5530
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Optional. It should have a value much less than 1 (e.g. 0.05 or 0.02) and is "
"used to prevent clipping."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Hauria de tindre un valor molt inferior a 1 (p. ex., 0,05 o 0,02) "
"i s'utilitza per a evitar el retallat."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_dctdnoiz.xml
